# content/beauty/looks/warm.cygrade — the beauty shot's warm look, from the parametric controls
# alone. `cy_sample_beauty --look content/beauty/looks/warm.cygrade` applies it at step 12 of the
# post chain, after the tone curve; `just capture-beauty-grading` photographs it beside the ungraded
# frame and the cool look.
#
# Late sun on stone: the white balance pulled toward 4 600 K, a little red gain and blue cut in the
# highlights, the blacks lifted warm by a hair, and a touch more contrast and colour to carry it.
cygrade 1
name Warm
temperature 4600
tint 0.02
lift 0.012 0.004 -0.004
gain 1.03 1.0 0.94
highlights-gain 1.03 1.0 0.95
contrast 1.06
saturation 1.08
